  - quality channel release
1.1.0 2026-09-21
  - Added the manufacturer's contact-quality and EEG-quality channels (33 per file) alongside
    the 14 EEG channels, in response to peer review. Documented in each channels.tsv and in
    the README.
  - Replaced the trailing zero padding present at the end of every v1.0.0 EDF with the actual
    continuation of the recording. File lengths, event onsets and durations are unchanged, and
    every sample of EEG released in v1.0.0 is bit-identical in v1.1.0.
  - README: added the fixed condition order, the calibration duration ranges, reader guidance,
    and a summary of the quality indices.

